    "body": "I could not get my username and hostname, what config do I miss?\r\n\r\nTerminal: Git bash\r\n\r\n```\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n$status \\\r\n$username\\\r\n$hostname\\\r\n$directory\\\r\n$git_branch\\\r\n$git_state\\\r\n$git_status\\\r\n$line_break\\\r\n$python\\\r\n$character\"\"\"\r\n\r\n[username]\r\nformat = \"[$user]($style)\"\r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\nformat = \" on [$hostname]($style)\"\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7020812/148188644-41c03f8e-e1d9-4474-95e1-70b5eca5989f.png)\r\n\r\n",
